SUMMARY:[Task] Profile 5/7: Link
DESCRIPTION:☐ Edit profile → Links → Add external link.\n☐ Paste th
 e URL and the title. The ?ref=ig shows Instagram visits in Cloudflare anal
 ytics.\n☐ Tap the link on your profile once to check it opens jaxsquares
 .com.\n\nURL:\nhttps://jaxsquares.com/?ref=ig\nTITLE:\nMake a board
