SUMMARY:[Task] Profile 7/7: Saved replies
DESCRIPTION:☐ Settings → Business tools and controls → Saved replies 
 → add the three above (shortcut\, then message).\n☐ In a DM or comment
  reply\, type the shortcut and tap the suggestion to send it.\n\nSHORTCUT 
 “LINK”:\nHere's the link: https://jaxsquares.com 🏈 Make a board\, t
 ext it to your crew\, and everyone picks from their phone.\nSHORTCUT “FR
 EE”:\nFree to set up and invite\, and free to draw with up to 5 players.
  Bigger boards are $4.99 for the host. Players never pay.\nSHORTCUT “APP
 ”:\nNo app needed. Friends tap the link and pick their squares from any 
 phone. Same room? They can scan the code.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Task: Profile 7/7: Saved replies
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
