SUMMARY:[Carousel] Grid 7/9: Free to set up
DESCRIPTION:Asset: g7-free-to-set-up/01.png\, g7-free-to-set-up/02.png\n\nC
 APTION:\nSquare 7 of 9 ✨ Free to set up.\n\nMaking a board\, inviting fr
 iends and picking squares are free\, and players never pay a thing. Boards
  with up to 5 players draw free\; bigger boards are $4.99 for the host at 
 the draw\, or covered by a Host Pass. JaxSquares never collects or sends m
 oney between players.\n\nTwo squares left 👀\n\n#footballsquares #square
 spool #officepool\n\nAlt text: A green board square reading “Free to set
  up”: square 7 of 9. Slide 2 shows the app's review step with Just for f
 un selected and the line “Free to set up and invite. Free to draw with u
 p to 5 players\, $4.99 for bigger boards.”\n\n• Launch grid\, top row 
 (top right). Post squares 7\, 8 and 9 back to back\, in order.
