SUMMARY:[Carousel] Seed post: how football squares works
DESCRIPTION:Asset: c1-how-squares-works/01.png\, c1-how-squares-works/02.pn
 g\, c1-how-squares-works/03.png\, c1-how-squares-works/04.png\, c1-how-squ
 ares-works/05.png\, c1-how-squares-works/06.png\, c1-how-squares-works/07.
 png\n\nCAPTION:\nHow football squares works\, in 7 slides 🏈\n\nThe grid
 \, the draw\, the last-digit rule and how a quarter gets won. Save this fo
 r game day.\n\nSend it to the person who always asks “wait\, which squar
 e is mine?”\n\nSet up your own board free → link in bio\n\n#footballsq
 uares #squarespool #officepool #fantasyfootball #gameday\n\nAlt text: Seve
 n-slide explainer of football squares: a 10 by 10 grid\, friends pick squa
 res\, digits 0 to 9 are drawn for each row and column\, and the last digit
  of each team's score picks the winning square each quarter.\n\n• Seed r
 ow: this\, Sunday's Reel and the launch Reel make one row over the grid. D
 on't pin it: pinned posts jump to the top and break the grid.
