SUMMARY:[Reel] Seed post: best and worst squares
DESCRIPTION:Asset: 04-best-worst-squares.mp4\, 04-best-worst-squares-cover.
 png\n\nCAPTION:\nThe best and worst squares in football\, from 7\,276 NFL 
 final scores 📊\n\n0–7 lands on 3.6% of finals. 2–2 has hit 4 times 
 since 1999. 💀\n\nSend this to whoever drew 2–2 this week.\n\n#footbal
 lsquares #squarespool #nfl #footballstats #fantasyfootball\n\n• Has its 
 own soundtrack\, with the drop on the reveal. To ride a trending sound ins
 tead (the ↗ arrow in the audio browser)\, add it in the Reels editor and
  turn the original audio down to 0–20%.\n• Upload the matching cover i
 mage as the Reel cover so the profile grid stays clean.\n• Top boost can
 didate (no money on screen).\n• Data: nflverse games.csv\, NFL finals 19
 99–2025.
